---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Kirian Luna — Software Engineer"
  description="I'm Kirian Luna, a software engineer based in Limón, Costa Rica. I build digital products with a focus on thoughtful design, sound architecture, and user experience."
  lang="en"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-grayscale-1">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-0 pt-28 pb-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
      
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div>
        <a
          href="/"
          data-cuelume-hover="tick"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 hover:text-grayscale-12 transition-colors select-none"
        >
          <span>←</span>
          <span>Home</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Intro Block -->
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3.5">
        <h1 class="text-sm font-semibold text-grayscale-12 font-mono tracking-tight select-none">
          About
        </h1>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-grayscale-11 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I'm Kirian Luna, a software engineer based in Limón, Costa Rica. I build digital products with a focus on thoughtful design, sound architecture, and the details that make software feel effortless to use.
          </p>
          <p>
            I work across the stack, from designing backend systems and data models to building responsive interfaces and refining user interactions. I'm interested in the intersection of software engineering and product design: not just making things work, but making them work well.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Minimal Two-Column Structured Sections -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 text-xs sm:text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Path -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Path</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              I hold a Bachelor's Degree in Computer Systems Engineering from <a href="https://www.ulatina.ac.cr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Universidad Latina de Costa Rica</a>. I'm currently continuing my academic journey in software engineering at Universidad Internacional de las Américas (UIA), while also pursuing a degree in Education at Universidad Americana (UAM).
            </p>
            <p>
              My academic background and professional experience complement each other: I enjoy solving technical problems, understanding how people use software, and building systems that are reliable, maintainable, and intuitive.
            </p>
            <p>
              At UMP, I work on digital solutions that support the company and its clients. Through Sorin Labs, my independent software studio, I design and build full-stack applications, business websites, internal tools, and custom APIs. My work combines modern web technologies with a strong focus on usability, performance, and long-term maintainability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Beyond the work -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Beyond the work</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              Outside client and team projects, I build independent tools and explore ideas that solve practical problems. I'm especially interested in the craft of the web: typography, interaction design, accessibility, and the engineering decisions behind fast, reliable experiences.
            </p>
            <p>
              I'm also interested in how technology can create opportunities and support meaningful projects in Costa Rica, while building products that can reach a wider audience.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Philosophy -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Philosophy</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              Good software is intentional. I value simple architectures, explicit types, accessible interfaces, and performance measured by real user experience.
            </p>
            <p>
              I prefer understanding a problem deeply over adding complexity for its own sake. Every dependency, abstraction, and interaction should have a reason to exist.
            </p>
            <p>
              The goal isn't to use the most technology. It's to build the right thing, well.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Connect -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Connect</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              I'm open to software engineering opportunities, collaborations, and conversations about building useful products.
            </p>
            <p>
              For professional inquiries, feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:kirianluna.u@gmail.com" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">kirianluna.u@gmail.com</a>, connect with me on <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kirianluna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">LinkedIn</a>, or explore my work on <a href="https://github.com/kirianL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">GitHub</a>. You can also get in touch through the <a href="/contact" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">contact page</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <Footer />
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
